                    given: Erreg
                value: Erreg the Kinslayer
            sex: male
        notes: Andal warlord who slaughtered the children of the forest at High Heart during the Andal invasion. His epithet 'the Kinslayer' likely refers to slaying kin-folk (those protected by the peace of the gods). Mentioned in TWOIAF.
